Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.53,0:00:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)哎呀～ 抱歉抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来晚了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.21,0:00:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)又补课了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才、才不是呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是右京老师非要教我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些我怎么都搞不懂的地方……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.59,0:00:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就叫补课。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.85,0:00:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(两人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能遇见你 真是太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么了啊 突然这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这么一本正经地说这种话……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.85,0:00:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 No.就交给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.46,0:00:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.57,0:00:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.23,0:00:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么我们会在这种地方……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:00:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}振作点 决斗还在进行中啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.96！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.89,0:01:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(No.96)怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到幻觉了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.58,0:01:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马 到底……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.49,0:01:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)确实 一副心不在焉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的表情。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.11,0:01:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然在这种地方擅自搞小动作。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 有意思……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个混沌力场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光是待着就会给那些家伙带来痛苦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.70,0:01:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开心地让我在这里好好观赏吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:03:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于心脏·地球·混沌龙的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炎之护封剑无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一手是关键。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次？你们这些家伙没有下次！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌之臂 对星尘直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.61,0:03:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.52,0:03:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力4000的直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.55,0:03:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.09,0:03:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤我我我守卫者。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将我我我守卫者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.56,0:03:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.23,0:03:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙在受到直接攻击时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.51,0:03:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.53,0:03:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为自己场上召唤了怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炎之护封剑被破坏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.31,0:03:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切 垂死挣扎。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.43,0:03:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌之臂 攻击我我我守卫者！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.52,0:03:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我守卫者的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡通过将1张手牌送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.26,0:03:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效战斗破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌中将救援兔送去墓地！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.77,0:04:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 伤害你还是得吃下。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.11,0:04:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们灭亡的命运 不会改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.19,0:04:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑风暴 攻击我我我守卫者！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.86,0:04:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间 黑风暴的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行战斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.41,0:04:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个混沌超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击将对方怪兽的攻击力变为零{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将那个数值的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加在黑风暴身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 战斗继续！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动墓地中救援兔的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这只怪兽除外
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.17,0:04:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效我我我守卫者的破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 将给予玩家的伤害变为零！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.43,0:04:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 真是不死心。太难看了 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.59,0:04:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们可不会输。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 心·地·混沌龙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击嘎嘎嘎嘎多纳。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值剩余500。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 凭那副破烂不堪的身体还打算继续战斗吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没……还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们还没输！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢的人类啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看看这个吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心·地·混沌龙的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.81,0:05:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这一回合的战斗中产生的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的伤害 3500点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加到我自己的生命值上！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.80,0:05:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 我的生命值是 7500！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.27,0:05:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值 7500！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.97,0:05:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……怎么会！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？ 明白了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是不可能赢的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们绝对不会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和星光界的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.30,0:06:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}羁绊之力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你见识一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.70,0:06:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪亮发光了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.57,0:06:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.79,0:06:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.49,0:06:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你已经打得很好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}稍微休息一下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.61,0:06:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…完全没事…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来就交给我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你那永不放弃的心。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有不回头{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带着笔直前进的意志不断向前走着。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}朝着所相信的事物。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.89,0:07:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论变成什么形式
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们都在一起战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.41,0:07:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，No.96，我来做你的对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无聊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么永不放弃的心什么勇往直前的意志！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和星光世界真是相似。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.46,0:07:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅凭一丝微不足道的恶意污渍就会崩溃的脆弱世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}证据就是，如今的我别说星光世界了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就连异晶界和人类世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都正要让其崩溃。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.78,0:07:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，我就是神一般的存在！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就在这里消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:07:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.23,0:08:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续魔法 No.业！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.33,0:08:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自身回合结束时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上没有 No.的场合
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.96,0:08:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.93,0:08:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，下个回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是召唤不出 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他们就输了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.73,0:08:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我们场上盖放的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.回归{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能把墓地里的 No.怪兽再次唤回。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.52,0:08:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在我们的墓地里，有希望
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.48,0:08:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有 光子蝶刺客 和
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园龙 在。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，No.业报
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明显是在诱导我的思考。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，恐怕那张盖卡是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，你要怎么出招，星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《是啊，游马》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.45,0:08:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:09:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《始终面向前方毫不犹豫地决斗吧！》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ No.回归！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.99,0:09:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡只能在自己的回合发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将自己墓地中的1只 No.怪兽特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 要选哪只 No.？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是光之使者 武装？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是心之龙？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.27,0:09:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要唤回的是 希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(霍普)霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.77,0:09:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 根据 No.回归的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地的 No.怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为霍普的超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明还有其他强力的 No.怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.57,0:09:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}却要复活霍普？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.33,0:09:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我和星光体的最初羁绊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.79,0:09:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论多么危险的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论何时 希望都必定在场。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望是和我们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.11,0:10:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并肩战斗最久的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望的伙伴啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我们才要相信！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢！那种名为相信的廉价感情{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.31,0:10:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会滋生嫉妒、猜疑与憎恨然后催生背叛。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.23,0:10:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把个体存在这种麻烦又
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烦人的东西抹消掉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要身为神的我一个人在就够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那才是理想的世界！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无聊……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.28,0:10:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无聊透顶！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.78,0:10:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种理想的世界我才不要！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家各不相同
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.03,0:10:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有各种各样的家伙在 才好啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.49,0:10:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然会失败也会犯错啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.91,0:10:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 犯了错的话有人去教他不就好了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正是为此 朋友才…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.62,0:10:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伙伴才存在的不是吗!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.94,0:10:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有伙伴在 合为一体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后就会产生两倍三倍超厉害的力量啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.94,0:11:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家一起活着才开心啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是很有意思吗!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.73,0:11:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.22,0:11:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两个人来做个了断吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.89,0:11:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是ZEXAL。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.61,0:11:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.71,0:11:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.27,0:11:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}火力全开!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.03,0:11:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和 我自己…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.57,0:11:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.71,0:11:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(２人)超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.94,0:11:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们两人构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以真正的羁绊相连当两人的心重合之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.63,0:11:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应当流传后世的奇迹将会显现。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.13,0:11:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马/星光)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.09,0:11:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:12:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔？ 但是事到如今做什么都晚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 伙伴的羁绊必定会将你击碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.89,0:12:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.54,0:12:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌异热同心变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo. 39。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.65,0:12:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将混沌化为光明的使者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普雷！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货。 陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.·死亡·封锁！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.11,0:12:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择1只 No.怪兽 发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.47,0:12:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择 希望皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被选为对象的怪兽不能攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个效果也不能使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 在回合的结束时被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 那个攻击力数值的伤害会给予你。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2500的伤害！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.76,0:12:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次真的完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.44,0:13:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.99,0:13:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心宝藏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1只场上的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.01,0:13:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就从卡组抽1张。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的怪兽有4只。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 抽4张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强决斗者的决斗 全都是必然。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.79,0:13:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就连抽到的卡 也是决斗者创造的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.40,0:13:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这4张卡将带给我胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.68,0:13:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望·之心·律动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冠有希望之名的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会受到对手卡的效果影响！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.81,0:13:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 已经发动的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡的效果 全部无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那些卡破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.87,0:13:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被解放的希望之光效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.83,0:13:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:14:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就上升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.77,0:14:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 将3个超量素材全部使用！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.16,0:14:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 因为这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方1只怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.71,0:14:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每使用1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.02,0:14:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择混沌·阿姆斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.21,0:14:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来才是重头戏。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.40,0:14:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.62,0:14:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤异热同心武器 雷神猛虎剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备在自己场上的希望皇霍普上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.09,0:14:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其攻击力数值
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.03,0:14:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加到希望皇霍普的攻击力上。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.59,0:14:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再接着 从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.70,0:14:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动速攻魔法 超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方场上怪兽的超量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}素材使用1个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌把1只等级4以下的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！ 我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤异热同心武器 阿修罗副腕。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.06,0:14:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.71,0:15:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备在自己场上的霍普雷身上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.14,0:15:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让它的攻击力提升！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后装备了阿修罗·破的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以对对手的所有怪兽发起攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你场上的怪兽有3只。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 攻击力6000的3次攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能！ 对所有怪兽都能攻击!?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.15,0:15:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算那家伙的生命值是7500…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.81,0:15:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就能把它打垮！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.93,0:15:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先攻击 心脏·地球·混沌龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太天真了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.08,0:15:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱 发动。 混沌·联盟!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.84,0:15:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的 CNo.的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成与同一场上 攻击力最高的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.24,0:15:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成和怪兽一样的攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.39,0:15:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 我的怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就全都是2500了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑·阿修罗·复仇者！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 攻击混沌·军武！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的只要把黑·风暴破坏掉就行了……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.49,0:16:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你忘了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.35,0:16:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑·风暴在战斗中被破坏时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会有一个效果 让双方玩家承受产生的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.03,0:16:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同样的招数 我不会中第二次！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 希望皇！ 攻击黑·风暴。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.79,0:16:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这个瞬间杀戮·钉甲的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让装备的怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成和对方怪兽一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.90,0:16:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想同归于尽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.42,0:16:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑·阿修罗·复仇者！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.71,0:17:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你们的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就不存在 No.怪兽了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.31,0:17:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个回合结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于 No.·卡玛的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.62,0:17:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将受到500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.23,0:17:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你失算了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.27,0:17:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合还没有结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)史雷普·尼尔之靴的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)装备的怪兽被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将墓地的希望皇 霍普特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.95,0:17:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)现身吧 希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.11,0:17:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不… 不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.21,0:17:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.69,0:17:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的希望必定会引领我们走向胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……身为神的我，居然会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(２人)上啊！！希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.71,0:17:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(２人)对 No.96直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑·拉格纳凯撒·斩！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽尔……游马和星光赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.11,0:18:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们赢了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.27,0:18:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，是我们的胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.11,0:18:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了，星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}输了……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.04,0:18:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身为神的我。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.41,0:18:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不可能会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站得起来吗？游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.62,0:18:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然说是你赢了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.01,0:18:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就把我收进那副身体里试试看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.96,0:19:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界…！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.93,0:19:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别过来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.39,0:19:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不许过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.36,0:19:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭你是救不了星光界的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.17,0:19:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是神。是神啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.43,0:19:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.06,0:19:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把一切…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把一切都消灭掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也是 你的同伴也是 全部！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不行 再这样下去…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.68,0:19:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.28,0:20:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.75,0:20:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 星光界！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.26,0:20:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.06,0:20:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你没事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！ 别乱来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要解除异热同心啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能把你卷进来。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊？我们是同伴吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴吗… 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.32,0:20:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为你是无可替代的同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你反复教会了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.47,0:20:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴的重要性
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}信任同伴的心。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.13,0:20:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.62,0:20:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.就拜托你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.63,0:20:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊 到底怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.52,0:20:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要告别啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.43,0:20:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.99,0:20:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要分开啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.09,0:21:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 等等啊 星光…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.32,0:21:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.83,0:21:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别去任何地方啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.37,0:21:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.09,0:21:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.53,0:21:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.77,0:21:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是原来的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.23,0:21:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对、对啊 阿斯特拉尔 阿斯特拉尔！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.67,0:21:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.69,0:22:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.59,0:23:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.70,0:23:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
